          "position_note": "整單位疑讀；非逐字位置認證。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_id": "c04",
      "index": 4,
      "width": 2200,
      "height": 2025,
      "official_label": "pp. [4]-[5]",
      "canvas_id": "https://iiif.bodleian.ox.ac.uk/iiif/canvas/c498aa5c-3700-4e1d-b586-7d7fb06ad0a2.json",
      "image_url": "https://iiif.bodleian.ox.ac.uk/iiif/image/c498aa5c-3700-4e1d-b586-7d7fb06ad0a2/full/2200,/0/default.jpg",
      "source_sha256": "441cbb1103454b55526081f84e0e9b905e4bf2c8139061ceaf1643ce95a1c17f",
      "layout_note": "右、左兩面連續宗教前言；版心葉碼與正文分列。",
      "layout_reviewed": true,
      "layer_states": {
        "original-print": "complete"
      },
      "units": [
        {
          "id": "c04-R01",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "preface",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "死亡自省、昔耶穌誨耶路撒冷人曰、爾曹",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c04-R02",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "preface",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "不悔改、亦必死亡、可見惡必受罰、當悔改",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c04-R03",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "preface",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "求免、況死後永苦、比生前重罰尤慘、勿謂",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c04-R04",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "preface",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "天堂地獄之說爲無稽也、近世風俗、人心",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c04-R05",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "preface",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "愈降愈下、故兵燹水旱、瘟疫疾病、無地無",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c04-R06",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "preface",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "之、諸禍中、恆多者惟疾病、顯見者亦惟疾",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c04-R07",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "preface",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "病、如貪花柳者、有疳疔麻瘋患、飲酒食洋",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c04-R08",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "preface",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "煙者、有損身致病患、好勇鬪狠者、有刀傷",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c04-R09",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "preface",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "患、此種病患、皆罪所當得、外此百般病患、",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c04-L01",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "preface",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "雖良民亦有不免者、推其原、皆因初世犯",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c04-L02",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "preface",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "罪而起、使初世遵　　天父命、不食禁果、",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c04-L03",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "preface",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "便全善無惡、不至貽累後世艱苦也、我輩",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c04-L04",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "preface",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "同生覆載內、有時歷水火而得拯救、染疾",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c04-L05",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "preface",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "病而得調劑、皆　　天父鴻慈默祐、不忍",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c04-L06",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "preface",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "卽罰以死亡、令人悔改、故病者固不可自",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c04-L07",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "preface",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "誇有福、醫者亦不能自居有功也、",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c04-R-folio",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "folio",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "一",
          "bbox": null
        }
      ],
      "uncertainties": []
    },
    {
      "page_id": "c05",
      "index": 5,
      "width": 2200,
      "height": 2025,
      "official_label": "pp. [6]-[7]",
      "canvas_id": "https://iiif.bodleian.ox.ac.uk/iiif/canvas/219be7e7-1d08-4961-8dac-36fd8aeb3888.json",
      "image_url": "https://iiif.bodleian.ox.ac.uk/iiif/image/219be7e7-1d08-4961-8dac-36fd8aeb3888/full/2200,/0/default.jpg",
      "source_sha256": "daa72d32229305a6d38d7d1181ba1b91e9a9c78e75d2653bd032142272182089",
      "layout_note": "右面空白但有版心數字；左面〈論瘧症〉起首及小字註。",
      "layout_reviewed": true,
      "layer_states": {
        "original-print": "complete"
      },
      "units": [
        {
          "id": "c05-R-folio",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "folio",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "二",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c05-L01",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "title",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "論瘧症",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c05-L02",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "瘧症俗名打擺子、病狀、先發寒、後發熱、至",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c05-L03",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "汗出而病暫退、或每日一作、或間日一",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c05-L04",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "作、或間兩日一作、患此症者、若不善爲調",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c05-L05",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "治、久則形枯體瘦、氣餒力衰、甚至或變蠱",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c05-L06",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "脹、或腹內脾肝體大異常、卽中土醫書所",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c05-L07",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "謂、久瘧腹有痞塊、名爲瘧母是也、大抵此",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c05-L08",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "症、秋天恆多、夏天亦不少、治法、最効是用",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c05-L09",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "金雞納霜、日服四次、每次六厘、",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c05-L09-N01",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "note",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "少則不効",
          "bbox": null
        }
      ],
      "uncertainties": [
