          "role": "folio",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "四",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c09-u02",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "夾住、夾之大小、須量人之肥瘦、恰合爲宜、",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c09-u03",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "愚見中土人醫此症、止用湯藥、偶可止痛、",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c09-u04",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "而不能令小腸送還本位、曷不令巧匠、照",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c09-u05",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "式仿造鋼夾、依法治之、乃爲有益也、並附",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c09-u06",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "鋼夾圖於後、",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c09-u07",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "figure-label",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "治小腸疝偏右鋼夾圖",
          "bbox": null
        }
      ],
